 * Framework: {{FRAMEWORK}} (Next.js App Router | Express | Fastify)
 * Product: {{PRODUCT_NAME}}
 *
 * Handles:
 * - subscription.created:  Generate and send license
 * - subscription.active:   Idempotent re-issue (renewals, late activations)
 * - subscription.updated:  Re-provision on plan change
 * - subscription.canceled: Mark pending_cancel — keep access alive until period end
 * - subscription.revoked:  Revoke access (fires at period end after cancel, or on dunning fail)
 *
 * Setup:
 * 1. Add POLAR_WEBHOOK_SECRET, POLAR_PRODUCT_ID, POLAR_ACCESS_TOKEN to .env
 * 2. npm install standardwebhooks
 * 3. Deploy this route
 * 4. Configure webhook in Polar Dashboard pointing at /api/webhooks/polar
 */

